@startgantt PuskesmasKu-SprintTimeline
' ============================================================
' SPRINT TIMELINE - 4 SPRINT x 2 MINGGU
' ============================================================
Project starts 2026-09-07
saturday are closed
sunday are closed
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam GanttTaskBackgroundColor #0F766E
skinparam GanttTaskBorderColor #0B3B36
skinparam GanttTaskFontColor #FFFFFF
skinparam GanttArrowColor #475569
skinparam GanttTodayColor #B4537A
skinparam GanttCalendarBackgroundColor #F8FAFC

[Sprint 1 - Foundation & Autentikasi] lasts 10 days
[Sprint 1 - Foundation & Autentikasi] is colored in #0F766E/#FFFFFF
[Sprint 2 - Pasien, Antrean & Display] starts at [Sprint 1 - Foundation & Autentikasi]'s end
[Sprint 2 - Pasien, Antrean & Display] lasts 10 days
[Sprint 2 - Pasien, Antrean & Display] is colored in #246B97/#FFFFFF
[Sprint 3 - EMR & Farmasi] starts at [Sprint 2 - Pasien, Antrean & Display]'s end
[Sprint 3 - EMR & Farmasi] lasts 10 days
[Sprint 3 - EMR & Farmasi] is colored in #6D5AA8/#FFFFFF
[Sprint 4 - Pembayaran & Laporan] starts at [Sprint 3 - EMR & Farmasi]'s end
[Sprint 4 - Pembayaran & Laporan] lasts 10 days
[Sprint 4 - Pembayaran & Laporan] is colored in #B4537A/#FFFFFF

[Sprint 1 Review] happens at [Sprint 1 - Foundation & Autentikasi]'s end
[Sprint 2 Review] happens at [Sprint 2 - Pasien, Antrean & Display]'s end
[Sprint 3 Review] happens at [Sprint 3 - EMR & Farmasi]'s end
[Release v1.0] happens at [Sprint 4 - Pembayaran & Laporan]'s end

@enduml
